<title>SPAIN: EIB issues equity-linked 5-1/2 matador bond - DMG.</title>
<headline>EIB issues equity-linked 5-1/2 matador bond - DMG.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Investment Bank (EIB) is issuing 15 billion pesetas in a five and half years equity-linked matador bond, said Deutsche Morgan Grenfell acting as book runner and lead manager.  </p>
<p>The bond matures on October 2002, and denominations are 1,000 pesetas.</p>
<p>The issue is divided in six tranches, 2.5 billion pesetas each. It is linked to five different share indices, MIB-30, CAC-40, Dax, Ibex-35, FTSE-100.</p>
<p>The coupon is not regular, between 4.30 percent and 4.55 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
